==Battleground==
*2 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**5 [[Metal Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Maawth]]s spawn, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**2 [[Sir Metal Seal]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
On this stage, [[:Category:Critter-class Cats|Critters]] are important to kill the pesky [[Metal Doge]]s and the [[Sir Metal Seal]]s. Bring any long ranger or alien/floating killer for the [[Maawth]]s, someone like [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Aphrodite]] would work great. The Aku enemies are not a large problem, just use your generalist attackers to deal with them quickly.

